<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Date de livraison confirmée</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #F9FAFB;">
<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color: #F9FAFB;">
    <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding: 20px 0;">
            <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden;">
                <!-- Header -->
                <tr>
                    <td style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #16C669 0%, #12A855 100%); padding: 40px 30px; text-align: center;">
                        <span style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 900; color: #ffffff;">RECYCLUM</span>
                    </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- Body -->
                <tr>
                    <td style="padding: 40px 30px;">
                        <!-- Icon -->
                        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                            <tr>
                                <td align="center" style="padding-bottom: 20px;">
                                    <span style="font-size: 56px; line-height: 1;">&#9989;</span>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <!-- Title -->
                        <h1 style="font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; color: #1F2937; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Date de livraison confirmée !</h1>
                        <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #6B7280; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 30px 0;">{{ order.deliveryFirstName }}, votre rendez-vous de livraison est enregistré.</p>

                        <!-- Date Box -->
                        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(22, 198, 105, 0.1) 0%, rgba(22, 198, 105, 0.05) 100%); border: 2px solid rgba(22, 198, 105, 0.4); border-radius: 16px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 30px; text-align: center;">
                                    <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #065F46; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">Date de livraison</p>
                                    <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 900; color: #16C669;">{{ appointment.formattedDate }}</p>
                                    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #047857;">Entre 9h et 18h</p>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <!-- Order Info -->
                        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background: #F9FAFB; border: 2px solid #E5E7EB; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 20px;">
                                    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                                        <tr>
                                            <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 15px; color: #6B7280; font-weight: 600;">Commande</td>
                                            <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 15px; color: #1F2937; font-weight: 700; text-align: right;">{{ order.orderNumber }}</td>
                                        </tr>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 15px; color: #6B7280; font-weight: 600;">Type de livraison</td>
                                            <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 15px; color: #1F2937; font-weight: 700; text-align: right;">
                                                {% if order.deliveryType == 'with_installation' %}
                                                    Livraison + Installation
                                                {% else %}
                                                    Livraison simple
                                                {% endif %}
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                    </table>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <!-- Address -->
                        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background: #F9FAFB; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 20px;">
                                    <h3 style="margin: 0 0 15px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #1F2937;">&#128205; Adresse de livraison</h3>
                                    <p style="margin: 0; color: #6B7280; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8;">
                                        {{ order.deliveryFirstName }} {{ order.deliveryLastName }}<br>
                                        {{ order.deliveryStreet }}<br>
                                        {% if order.deliveryStreetComplement %}{{ order.deliveryStreetComplement }}<br>{% endif %}
                                        {{ order.deliveryPostalCode }} {{ order.deliveryCity }}<br>
                                        &#128222; {{ order.deliveryPhone }}
                                    </p>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <!-- Order Items -->
                        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background: #F9FAFB; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 20px;">
                                    <h3 style="margin: 0 0 15px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #1F2937;">Articles de votre commande</h3>
                                    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                                        {% for item in order.items %}
                                        <tr>
                                            <td style="padding: 10px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #1F2937; font-weight: 600; border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB;">{{ item.productTitle }}</td>
                                            <td style="padding: 10px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #6B7280; text-align: right; border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB;">x{{ item.quantity }}</td>
                                        </tr>
                                        {% endfor %}
                                    </table>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <!-- Checklist -->
                        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
                            <tr>
                                <td>
                                    <h3 style="margin: 0 0 20px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #1F2937;">A prévoir pour le jour J</h3>

                                    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                                        <tr>
                                            <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4B5563;">
                                                <span style="color: #16C669; margin-right: 10px;">&#10004;</span>
                                                Assurez-vous d'être présent à l'adresse indiquée
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4B5563;">
                                                <span style="color: #16C669; margin-right: 10px;">&#10004;</span>
                                                Préparez l'emplacement pour votre appareil
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                        <tr>
                                            <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4B5563;">
                                                <span style="color: #16C669; margin-right: 10px;">&#10004;</span>
                                                Dégagez le passage pour faciliter la livraison
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                        {% if order.deliveryType == 'with_installation' %}
                                        <tr>
                                            <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #4B5563;">
                                                <span style="color: #16C669; margin-right: 10px;">&#10004;</span>
                                                Vérifiez les raccordements nécessaires (eau, électricité)
                                            </td>
                                        </tr>
                                        {% endif %}
                                    </table>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <!-- Info Message -->
                        <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background: #EFF6FF; border-left: 4px solid #3B82F6; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding: 15px 20px;">
                                    <p style="margin: 0; color: #1E40AF; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;">
                                        <strong>Bon à savoir :</strong> Vous serez contacté la veille de la livraison pour confirmer un créneau horaire plus précis. Gardez votre téléphone à portée de main !
                                    </p>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- Footer -->
                <tr>
                    <td style="background: #1F2937; padding: 30px; text-align: center;">
                        <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #ffffff;">Une question sur votre livraison ? <a href="mailto:contact@recyclum.com" style="color: #16C669; text-decoration: none;">Contactez-nous</a></p>
                        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);">&copy; {{ "now"|date('Y') }} Recyclum - Electroménager reconditionné</p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
